Model Context Protocol schemas

src/vendor/2026-07-28/ and src/vendor/2025-06-18/ contain unchanged upstream
schemas and their license/provenance artifacts from:

https://github.com/modelcontextprotocol/modelcontextprotocol
Commit: 271ecc9accafdd9b83a3c869fa67c22953b2af80

The upstream license identifies:
Copyright (c) 2024-2025 Model Context Protocol a Series of LF Projects, LLC.

The distributed package retains the unchanged schema.ts, LICENSE, and
provenance.json for both revisions under dist/vendor/<revision>/, alongside
compiled JavaScript and declarations derived from the schemas. The preserved
upstream LICENSE describes an MIT to Apache-2.0 transition, with different terms
applying to different contributions; it is not a choice of either license for
all upstream material. Those terms continue to apply to the vendored schemas
and their compiled forms. Toolgrain's MIT grant does not replace them.

The upstream license's CC-BY-4.0 statement concerns documentation excluding
specifications. This package vendors the protocol schemas, not upstream
documentation pages. The complete upstream license text is retained unchanged.
